{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"お疲れ様\r\n──よく頑張った","trans":"辛苦了\n——你真的很努力","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6016003090030","name":"千雪","text":"────はい…………","trans":"────是…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"…………\r\n俺が言うのも、変なんだけどさ","trans":"…………\n虽然由我来说有点奇怪","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-10","name":"プロデューサー","text":"俺、\r\nなんか……","trans":"我，\n总觉得……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"よかったなって、\r\n思ってて","trans":"我一直在想，\n真是太好了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────この気持ち、わかってもらえるかな","trans":"————这份心情，你能明白吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6016003090060","name":"千雪","text":"──────ふふっ…………","trans":"——————呵呵…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6016003090070","name":"千雪","text":"わかります","trans":"我明白","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6016003090080","name":"千雪","text":"……やってきましたから","trans":"……因为我已经走过来了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6016003090090","name":"千雪","text":"──\r\n全部の自分が胸を張れるような────","trans":"——\n让全部的自己都能挺起胸膛的————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6016003090100","name":"千雪","text":"そんなステージ","trans":"那样的舞台","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}